  "store": {
    "tagline": "Your opening hours as a neat table, with a live Open now badge.",
    "longDescription": "Opening Hours shows when you are open, the way visitors want to know it: a clear table for the week, today highlighted, and a badge that says Open now · closes at 17:00, or Closed now · opens tomorrow at 09:00.\n\nType [opening-hours] on any page for the table, or [open-now] for the badge alone, and publish. You can also show the badge or the table in the footer of every page.\n\nEnter each day like 09:00-17:00, add a lunch break with a second range, or write closed. Choose your time zone, so the badge is right for visitors abroad too, and a language for the day names: English, Dutch, German or French. A short note, such as Closed on public holidays, goes under the table.\n\nThe table is plain HTML and works without JavaScript. Whether you are open right now is worked out when a visitor looks, not when the page was published, by a few hundred bytes of script. The plugin asks for one permission, storage, to keep your hours.",
    "icon": "icon.png",
